        "category": "ancestry",
        "description": {
            "value": "<p>You lock eyes with a target creature that can see you, overwhelming it with your ethereal beauty. You attempt an @Check[intimidation|against:will] check against the target's Will DC. On a success, the target can't take any hostile actions against you until the end of its next turn. If you use a hostile action against the target, the effect ends. The target becomes immune to Focus Beauty for 24 hours regardless of the result.</p>"
